# Flow Testing and Closure

## Quality gates (run before closure)

```bash
npx pnpm@11.16.0 install
npx pnpm@11.16.0 typecheck
npx pnpm@11.16.0 lint
npx pnpm@11.16.0 test
NODE_ENV=production npx pnpm@11.16.0 build
node --test .cursor/hooks/tests/*.test.mjs
```

## E2E requirements

- `--workers=1` for phase journeys
- Zero skipped mandatory tests
- Authenticated journey requires credentials in `.env.local`
- Visual regression baselines require explicit PO approval marker

## Closure evidence manifest

Required fields in `.cursor/quality/evidence-manifest.json`:

- Per-category verdicts (functionality, visual, accessibility, security, data-integrity, browser, performance)
- `commandsRun`, `testCounts`, `skippedTestCount`
- `screenshotPaths`, `criticReports`
- `productOwnerVisualApproval` (must be explicit for visual PASS)

## Independent reviewers

Before closure, invoke relevant subagents:

- `flow-ui-critic` — visual audit
- `flow-functional-reviewer` — journey verification
- `flow-security-reviewer` — auth/RLS/secrets
- `flow-investor-demo-reviewer` — demo journey quality
